The MIT license below covers this repository, including the pictures
in godot/assets/ and docs/screenshots/.

The barrel, bollard, cart, crate, and torch are built by build_prop()
in ai-rpg-stage, file assets/dimetric/camera/dimetric_60_45.py, from
Blender primitives. That function landed in commit 55ac9b2. The
manifest note "vendor; no remake" means those plates were copied from
that repository and not remade.

